[2026-06-13 18:11:48] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"32d40bdf-3481-40af-a99d-16267c06647a","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\32d40bdf-3481-40af-a99d-16267c06647a.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\claude-code-cli-doc\\Claude-API实战手册\\agent-patterns_chief-of-staff-agent.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\claude-code-cli-doc\\Claude-API实战手册\\agent-patterns_chief-of-staff-agent.md","content":"# Cookbook / Agent-Patterns / Chief-Of-Staff-Agent\n\n> 来源: claudecn.com\n\n# Chief of staff agent（参谋长代理）\n\n当一个 agent 不只是要“把事做完”，还要遵守团队的输出风格、权限边界、hooks 规则与计划方式时，这个例子就会很有参考价值。\n\n它很适合用来理解：怎样把个人试验，推进成团队可复用的工作流。\n\n## 读的时候重点看\n\n- 输出风格：settings + setting_sources=[\"project\"]\n- hooks 加载：setting_sources=[\"project\",\"local\"]\n- 工具权限收紧：allowed_tools=[...]\n## 什么时候更适合用它\n\n- 团队希望输出风格更统一\n- 本地自动化或 hooks 会直接影响 agent 行为\n- 权限与审查边界的重要性已经不低于提示词本身\n## 如果你想本地复现\n\n在本地环境已经准备好之后，可以对这个主题对应的示例做结构检查：\n\n```bash\nmake test-notebooks NOTEBOOK=claude_agent_sdk/01_The_chief_of_staff_agent.ipynb\n```\n","numLines":28,"startLine":1,"totalLines":28}},"tool_use_id":"call_6112960692db47af94ee3961","duration_ms":8}
