[2026-06-13 18:13:47] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"32d40bdf-3481-40af-a99d-16267c06647a","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\32d40bdf-3481-40af-a99d-16267c06647a.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\claude-code-cli-doc\\Claude-API实战手册\\integrations-and-ops_elevenlabs-voice-assistant.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\claude-code-cli-doc\\Claude-API实战手册\\integrations-and-ops_elevenlabs-voice-assistant.md","content":"# Cookbook / Integrations-And-Ops / Elevenlabs-Voice-Assistant\n\n> 来源: claudecn.com\n\n# 低延迟语音助手（ElevenLabs）\n\n把 STT/TTS 与 Claude 组合成低延迟语音助手的示例。\n\n外部依赖与 Key 往往比较多，先把环境变量、限流与成本盘清楚再动手。\n\n- 对应 notebook：third_party/ElevenLabs/low_latency_stt_claude_tts.ipynb\n## 读的时候重点看\n\n- 流式与延迟预算\n- STT/TTS 的重试与容错\n- 语音输出的安全控制\n## 怎么在本地跑\n\n```bash\nmake test-notebooks NOTEBOOK=third_party/ElevenLabs/low_latency_stt_claude_tts.ipynb\n```\n","numLines":22,"startLine":1,"totalLines":22}},"tool_use_id":"call_c563704cffa342738f8f7b21","duration_ms":5}
