 \"failed to list machines\")\n\t\treturn\n\t}\n\n\t// 确保返回空数组而非 null\n\tif machines == nil {\n\t\tmachines = []store.Machine{}\n\t}\n\n\titems := make([]MachineListItem, len(machines))\n\tfor i, m := range machines {\n\t\titems[i] = MachineListItem{\n\t\t\tID:          m.ID,\n\t\t\tMachineID:   m.MachineID,\n\t\t\tOS:          m.OS,\n\t\t\tHostname:    m.Hostname,\n\t\t\tUsername:    m.Username,\n\t\t\tFirstSeenAt: m.FirstSeenAt,\n\t\t\tLastSeenAt:  m.LastSeenAt,\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\twriteJSON(w, http.StatusOK, MachinesListResponse{Machines: items})\n}\n","numLines":66,"startLine":1,"totalLines":66}},"tool_use_id":"call_8e24278e09fc4821b4c2a390","duration_ms":1}
