n│   │   │   └── session_reader.go      # 只读端口(读 session 关联的 trace/token)\n│   │   └── adapter/\n│   │       └── driving/http/\n│   │           ├── token_handler.go   # ← api/session_handler.go 的 token 部分\n│   │           ├── trace_handler.go   # ← api/session_handler.go 的 trace 部分\n│   │           ├── log_handler.go     # ← api/log_handler.go\n│   │           └── status_handler.go  # ← api/status_handler.go\n│   │   # 注:domain/token.go(TokenStats) → observability/application/dto.go\n│   │\n│   │ ═══════════════ 支撑域 ⑤ ProxyRegistry(代理台账,简化 Hexagonal)═══════════════\n│   ├── proxyregistry/\n│   │   ├── domain/\n│   │   │   └── proxy.go               # ← store/store.go 的 Proxy 实体\n│   │   ├── application/\n│   │   │   └── registry.go            # ← service/proxy_service.go(注册/注销/心跳)\n│   │   ├── ports/\n│   │   │   └── repository.go          # ← store/store.go 的 ProxyStore 接口\n│   │   └── adapter/\n│   │       ├── driving/http/\n│   │       │   ├── handler.go         # ← api/proxy_handler.go\n│   │       │   └── trace_init.go      # ← api/proxy_handler.go 的 trace-init 转发(缓存)\n│   │       └── driven/sqlite/\n│   │           └── repository.go      # ← store/proxy_store.go\n│   │\n│   │ ═══════════════ 通用域 ⑥ SysConfig(简化 Hexagonal)═══════════════\n│   ├── sysconfig/\n│   │   ├── application/\n│   │   │   └── config.go              # ← service/config_service.go\n│   │   ├── ports/\n│   │   │   └── repository.go          # ← store/store.go 的 ConfigStore 接口\n│   │   └── adapter/\n│   │       ├── driving/http/\n│   │       │   └── handler.go         # ← api/config_handler.go\n│   │       └── driven/sqlite/\n│   │           └── repository.go      # ← store/config_store.go\n│   │   # 注:backend/config.go(Config 结构体) → sysconfig/domain/config.go\n│   │\n│   │ ═══════════════ 管道 ⑦ ProxyCapture(Pipeline,非 Hexagonal)═══════════════\n│   ├── proxycapture/\n│   │   ├── pipeline.go                # ← proxy/reverse.go 的编排 + main.go 的装配逻辑\n│   │   │                              #    CaptureSession:串联 sse→trace→usage\n│   │   ├── reverse_proxy.go           # ← proxy/reverse.go 的 ServeHTTP 主干\n│   │   ├── headers.go                 # ← proxy/headers.go\n│   │   ├── paths.go                   # ← proxy/paths.go\n│   │   ├── netutil.go                 # ← proxy/netutil.go\n│   │   ├── reasoning_cache.go         # ← proxy/reasoning_cache.go(kimi 模式)\n│   │   ├── sse/\n│   │   │   ├── reassembler.go         # ← sse/reassembler.go\n│   │   │   └── types.go               # ← sse/types.go\n│   │   ├── trace/\n│   │   │   ├── writer.go              # ← trace/writer.go(领域逻辑:记录构建)\n│   │   │   └── anthropic.go           # ← trace/anthropic.go\n│   │   └── usage/\n│   │       ├── normalize.go           # ← usage/normalize.go\n│   │       └── anthropic.go           # ← usage/anthropic.go\n│   │\n│   │ ═══════════════ CLI 能力 ⑧ SessionSync(过程式)═══════════════\n│   ├── sessionsync/\n│   │   ├── collect.go                 # ← session/collect.go(push 收集)\n│   │   ├── restore.go                 # ← session/restore.go(pull 恢复)\n│   │   ├── status.go                  # ← session/status.go(状态查询)\n│   │   ├── meta.go                    # ← session/meta.go(元数据)\n│   │   └── slug.go                    # ← session/slug.go\n│   │\n│   │ ═══════════════ CLI 能力 ⑨ Deploy(过程式)═══════════════\n│   ├── deploy/\n│   │   ├── deploy.go                  # ← deploy/deploy.go\n│   │   ├── copy.go                    # ← deploy/copy.go\n│   │   ├── filter.go                  # ← deploy/filter.go\n│   │   ├── target.go                  # ← deploy/target.go\n│   │   ├── template.go                # ← deploy/template.go\n│   │   ├── backup.go                  # ← deploy/backup.go\n│   │   └── lock.go                    # ← deploy/lock.go\n│   │\n│   │ ═══════════════ 组合根 COMPOSITION ROOT ═══════════════\n│   ├── bootstrap/                     # 装配:创建 sqlite → 注入各 adapter → 注册路由 → 起 server\n│   │   ├── wire.go                    # ← backend/server.go 的 Start() 主体(依赖装配)\n│   │   └── router.go                  # ← api/router.go(汇总所有上下文路由)\n│   │\n│   └── testutil/\n│       └── fixture.go                 # ← testutil/fixture.go\n│\n├── template/                          # 静态模板资源(不变)\n│\n└── tests/                             # 按上下文/链路组织\n    ├── issueclaim/                    # ← tests/backend/issue_api_test.go\n    ├── session/                       # ← tests/backend/session_api_test.go\n    ├── proxycapture/                  # ← tests/proxy/, tests/sse/, tests/trace/, tests/usage/, tests/e2e/\n    ├── sessionsync/                   # ← tests/session/\n    ├── deploy/                        # ← tests/deploy/\n    ├── integration/                   # ← tests/integration/\n    └── shell/                         # ← tests/shell/\n```\n\n## 关键迁移规则(重构时遵守)\n\n1. **业务逻辑上移**:`issue_store.go` / `session_store.go` 里的状态机、原子判断 → 拆到对应 `domain/`,留下来的 `driven/sqlite/repository.go` 只剩纯 SQL。\n2. **接口归位**:原 `store/store.go` 里散落的 `IssueStore`/`SessionStore`/`MachineStore`… 等接口 → 拆到各上下文的 `ports/repository.go`(端口定义跟着领域走)。\n3. **DTO 拆分**:原 `api/request.go`(一个大文件所有 DTO)→ 按上下文拆进各自的 `adapter/driving/http/dto.go`;通用的 `APIError`/响应封装 → `shared/http/`。\n4. **路由汇总**:`api/router.go` → `bootstrap/router.go`,它 import 所有上下文的 `adapter/driving/http` 并挂路由。\n5. **装配下沉**:`backend/server.go` 拆两半 —— HTTP 监听/信号/watchdog 进 `infrastructure/httpserver/`,依赖注入(new store → new adapter → new handler → router)进 `bootstrap/wire.go`。\n6. **import 方向铁律**:`domain` 包零 import `adapter`/`infrastructure`;跨上下文只允许 `application` 层互调或走领域事件,绝不 domain 直接 import 别的 domain。\n\n---\n\n要不要我现在把这个结构 + 迁移规则落成一个 **`docs/architecture.md`** 提交进仓库,作为后续重构的基准文档?还是直接进入**分步迁移计划**(从哪个上下文开始、每步保证可编译可测)?","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}
